    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/9172d42b88be5e56448be5b8ec48f967.avif?t=1711551622\" width=610 height=111 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/d70a55a0ef7f36869020254bce51bd8c.poster.avif?t=1711551622\" width=610 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/d70a55a0ef7f36869020254bce51bd8c.webm?t=1711551622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/d70a55a0ef7f36869020254bce51bd8c.mp4?t=1711551622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Where am I pyooooo???<br>HEBEREKE is back and so is his great and surreal adventure!<br><br>A mysterious little creature Hebe fell into a mysterious world.<br>Discover a brand new world, explore every corner, find the treasures with your new wonderful friends, and use their skills to find new places.<br><br>The &quot;Enjoy Edition&quot; adds two new modes, useful features and challenging elements.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/8eb793dade5bafd5f2e1167949744912.avif?t=1711551622\" width=610 height=111 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/b6326a71821c809a3cb7dec3bddd5aa1.poster.avif?t=1711551622\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/b6326a71821c809a3cb7dec3bddd5aa1.webm?t=1711551622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/b6326a71821c809a3cb7dec3bddd5aa1.mp4?t=1711551622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You can rewind anytime by pressing the Rewind button.<br>(*This function can be enabled or disabled)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/ff57984c812397435d37524c75365110.poster.avif?t=1711551622\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/ff57984c812397435d37524c75365110.webm?t=1711551622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/ff57984c812397435d37524c75365110.mp4?t=1711551622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You can save and load your play anytime. Up to 12 slots can be saved.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/55a274b58cbfe7ba2683510da20e537c.poster.avif?t=1711551622\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/55a274b58cbfe7ba2683510da20e537c.webm?t=1711551622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/55a274b58cbfe7ba2683510da20e537c.mp4?t=1711551622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> In Enjoy mode, the status of achievements can be displayed.<br>(*Achievement display can be optionally switched ON/OFF.)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/1343df2c92a242a6344c2661cdab06a3.poster.avif?t=1711551622\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/1343df2c92a242a6344c2661cdab06a3.webm?t=1711551622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/1343df2c92a242a6344c2661cdab06a3.mp4?t=1711551622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Hebe's wall climbing and Jennifer's rapid ascent from underwater, can be made easier with continuous firing (jumping)!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/16d393b11d6e72c373417232a57cb18c.avif?t=1711551622\" width=610 height=111 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/e006de2db374ccc672d637f762acdd81.poster.avif?t=1711551622\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/e006de2db374ccc672d637f762acdd81.webm?t=1711551622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/e006de2db374ccc672d637f762acdd81.mp4?t=1711551622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>This is the mode to see how fast you can clear the game.<br>In RANKING, you can compete with users all around the world by total time and challenge to set a new record! In addition to the total time to clear the game, the time to pass check points are also recorded.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/3dffd201c9e13da015ddb438bf06d00d.avif?t=1711551622\" width=610 height=111 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/10eaaa4ff2416f90b3a527ebf8dc1851.poster.avif?t=1711551622\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/10eaaa4ff2416f90b3a527ebf8dc1851.webm?t=1711551622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/10eaaa4ff2416f90b3a527ebf8dc1851.mp4?t=1711551622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>1)Enjoy the story twice as much with Special Snaps.</strong><br>Every time you discover a new event, you get a special snapshot! At any time during the game, you can enjoy comparative images and Japanese-English translations of the Japanese version of &quot;HEBEREKE&quot; and the Nordic version of &quot;Ufouria: The Saga&quot;. You can see how that scene in &quot;HEBEREKE&quot; looks like in &quot;Ufouria: The Saga&quot;...!<br>And the unique and expressive Hebe language in English translation! From core fans to international users, you can enjoy the story of &quot;HEBEREKE&quot; to the fullest. Two worlds with different characters and stories. Record every scene and discover the mystery of HEBEREKE. (Can you make it?)<br>The in-game menu is available in Japanese and English, but the main story of &quot;HEBEREKE&quot; is only in Japanese. Please enjoy the English translation at Special Snap.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/be918f17fae024d3c85be7cbf521d2b5.avif?t=1711551622\" width=610 height=342 /></span><br><strong>2) Extra</strong><br>You can browse the package designs and instructions for the original versio of HEBEREKE.<br>You can also view the package design and instructions for the Nordic version of 'Ufouria: The Saga'.<br>(*Instructions can also be viewed from the menu in each game.)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/004ce0aaa2b7b60925b56eb1fa37d984.avif?t=1711551622\" width=610 height=342 /></span><br><strong>3) Achievements</strong><br>You can view all 35 achievements from the title screen.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869000/extras/c4897a080f88f7a07ad550f595519496.avif?t=1711551622\" width=610 height=342 /></span><br><strong>4) Ranking</strong><br>This is the mode to see how fast you can clear the game.<br>In Ranking, you can compete with users all around the world by total time and challenge to set a new record!<br><br><br><strong>\u2605About HEBEREKE</strong><br>HEBEREKE is a game developed by Sunsoft in 1991.<br>The main character, Hebe, is a little creature with a unique manner of speaking. The comical universe of the game and its cute characters are what made it so popular back then.<br>Another reason for its popularity is its action maze-like design. The player must explore every corner of the map to find their way in this surreal universe. The soundtrack is also to be mentioned: in contrast to the surreal world depicted, the music is more down-to-earth and straight to the point.",
